{{Documentation}}
For writing the rules of [[Otherworld Colosseum]] stages.

==Usage==
<pre>
{{ColosseumRule|Trust Fund}}
</pre>
yields
{{ViewSource|{{ColosseumRule|Trust Fund}}}}

E.g. see [[Round 1 (Trust Fund)]].

<pre>
{{ColosseumRule|Uniform Motion|12}}
</pre>
yields
{{ViewSource|{{ColosseumRule|Uniform Motion|12}}}}

E.g. see [[Round 1 (Uniform Motion)]].

==Updating data==
Data is taken from [[Otherworld Colosseum/rules]], which uses the [[Template:ColosseumRule/data|ColosseumRule/data]] template.